---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="404 · 宇宙分支不存在" period="404">
  <div class="relative flex min-h-[70vh] flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden py-10">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[-4rem] top-1/2 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] -translate-y-1/2 halftone dot-fade text-[var(--color-hero)] opacity-[0.16]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <span class="caption rise d1">读取失败 / SIGNAL LOST</span>

      <h1 class="display rise d2 mt-4 leading-[0.8]">
        <span class="ink-outline jump-shadow block text-[7rem] text-[var(--color-hero)] sm:text-[12rem]"
          >404</span
        >
      </h1>

      <p class="rise d3 mt-5 max-w-lg text-lg font-bold leading-relaxed">
        这条宇宙分支没有被收录。可能是页号印错，也可能是它在上一次
        <span class="bg-[var(--color-reactor)] px-1">时间线重启</span>里被删掉了。
      </p>

      <p
        class="rise d3 mt-3 font-mono text-[0.66rem] tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]"
      >
        ERR_CODE: 616-EXTINCTION · RECOMMEND: RETURN TO MAIN EARTH
      </p>

      <div class="rise d4 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="btn-616">返回主宇宙 →</a>
        <a href="/archive" class="btn-616 btn-ghost">翻档案库</a>
      </div>

      <div
        class="sticker absolute right-2 top-24 hidden rotate-[9deg] px-4 py-2 text-sm sm:block"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        WRONG EARTH · 838
      </div>

      <div class="balloon rise d5 mt-14 max-w-sm -rotate-1 text-sm">
        「别慌，616 是主宇宙。分支炸了不影响主刊连载。」
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
